        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    advances = 1200\n    declines = 800\n    prior_19_day_ema = 150\n    prior_39_day_ema = 100\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    net_advances = advances - declines\n    ema_19_day = (net_advances * 0.10) + (prior_19_day_ema * 0.90)\n    ema_39_day = (net_advances * 0.05) + (prior_39_day_ema * 0.95)\n    mcclellan_oscillator = ema_19_day - ema_39_day\n    answer = round(mcclellan_oscillator, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
